  "description": "Given a 2D integer matrix, return a matrix where each cell is the floor of the average of the 3x3 surrounding cells.",
  "pseudocode": "for r from 0 to m-1:\n  for c from 0 to n-1:\n    sum = 0, count = 0\n    for i from r-1 to r+1:\n      for j from c-1 to c+1:\n        if 0 <= i < m and 0 <= j < n:\n          sum += img[i][j], count++\n    res[r][c] = floor(sum / count)",
